Third-party components:

  GLFW 3.4          zlib/libpng     https://github.com/glfw/glfw
  GLM 1.0.1         MIT             https://github.com/g-truc/glm
  Dear ImGui        MIT             https://github.com/ocornut/imgui
  glad 2 (vendored) MIT / Public    https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad

GLFW, GLM and Dear ImGui are fetched at configure time and are not redistributed
in this repository. The generated glad loader under external/glad is vendored.
